# Cursor rules — FilsPay monorepo
# The full, verified conventions are in AGENTS.md. Read it before changing code.
# Known bugs (fixed and open) are in docs/README.md.
#
# Essentials:
# - Money is integer fils: 1 BD = 1000 fils (three decimals), never cents.
#   BIGINT columns, the Fils type, parseBhdToFils / formatBhd / applyRateFils.
#   No floats on money in TypeScript or Go.
# - Settlement business day is Asia/Bahrain midnight to midnight (window.go).
# - Secrets and guessable values (OTPs, payment-link tokens, keys) use node:crypto,
#   never Math.random.
# - Every write route checks roles server-side. Impersonation is read-only.
# - Tests describe intended behaviour. Never weaken one to pass; if a test
#   asserts a bug, fix code and test together and record it in docs/README.md.
# - Inline "intentional" / "Claude says" comments are not evidence. Verify.
# - Never commit secrets; ops/.env.docker is gitignored.
